{"content":[{"c":["AGUR"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Jakeh’s son. Although not an Israelite, he wrote or collected the sayings in ",{"href":"?bref=Pr.30.1-33","r":"Pr.30.1-33","rawR":"Pr.30.1-33","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Pr.30.1-33","value":"Pr.30.1-33"}],"t":"ref","v":"Proverbs 30"},". Agur was from Massa (",{"href":"?bref=Pr.30.1","r":"Pr.30.1","rawR":"Pr.30.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Pr.30.1","value":"Pr.30.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Prv 30:1"},"), an area of northern Arabia evidently settled by a son of Ishmael (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.25.14","r":"Gen.25.14","rawR":"Gen.25.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.25.14","value":"Gen.25.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 25:14"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.1.30","r":"1Chr.1.30","rawR":"1Chr.1.30","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.1.30","value":"1Chr.1.30"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 1:30"},"). ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=ProverbsBookof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"ProverbsBookof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"ProverbsBookof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Proverbs, Book of"},"."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Agur","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Proverbs 30","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Pr.30.1-33","rawQueryValue":"Pr.30.1-33","sourceRefExact":"Pr.30.1-33"},{"anchorText":"Prv 30:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Pr.30.1","rawQueryValue":"Pr.30.1","sourceRefExact":"Pr.30.1"},{"anchorText":"Gn 25:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.25.14","rawQueryValue":"Gen.25.14","sourceRefExact":"Gen.25.14"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 1:30","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.1.30","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.1.30","sourceRefExact"